### 1. 조건 없음 (기존 동작과 같아야 함)
GET http://localhost:8080/posts

### 2. keyword만
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?keyword=1000000

### 3. memberId만
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?memberId=4

### 4. keyword + memberId
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?keyword=99999&memberId=4

### 5. 조건 + 커서 (memberId=4 첫 응답의 nextCursor를 붙여서)
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?memberId=4&cursor=2026-10-04T23:02:12_225

### 6. 결과 없는 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?keyword=없는제목
